WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.890
To the north lay Tashir,
a land of forest and deep gorges

2
00:00:06.930 --> 00:00:08.863
in the valleys of the Debed.

3
00:00:08.903 --> 00:00:12.984
In 890 Smbat I
became king of Armenia.

4
00:00:13.344 --> 00:00:17.909
But the Sajid emir Yusuf
claimed Armenia in the caliph's name.

5
00:00:17.949 --> 00:00:23.779
About 913 he besieged the king
in Kapuyt Berd, the Blue Fortress,

6
00:00:23.819 --> 00:00:25.882
and Smbat gave himself up.

7
00:00:25.922 --> 00:00:27.952
Yusuf did not spare him;

8
00:00:27.992 --> 00:00:31.013
Armenians remember him
as Smbat the Martyr.

9
00:00:31.373 --> 00:00:33.854
But his son Ashot would not yield.

10
00:00:33.894 --> 00:00:37.304
He drove the emir's men
from many of the strongholds

11
00:00:37.344 --> 00:00:38.674
they had seized.

12
00:00:38.714 --> 00:00:42.624
The Georgian king Adarnase,
his close ally,

13
00:00:42.664 --> 00:00:45.423
set the crown of Armenia
on his head.

14
00:00:45.463 --> 00:00:48.418
Ashot came to be called
Erkat, the Iron.

15
00:00:48.778 --> 00:00:53.408
Within two generations,
the monasteries of Sanahin and Haghpat

16
00:00:53.448 --> 00:00:56.045
rose above the Debed canyon.

17
00:00:56.405 --> 00:00:58.983
Hold the forest roads.

